//  Organization/Document/Recommendation as @Model classes) that lived loose
//  at the repo root, outside AiOSCore/Sources and not referenced by
//  Package.swift. The current, actively-built model layer is the
//  AiOSObject struct design in AiOSCore/Sources/AiOSCore/Entities.swift and
//  CanonicalObject.swift (dated 7/14 onward). Kept here for reference only;
//  safe to delete permanently once confirmed unneeded.
